{
  "id": "agent-query-conclusion-first",
  "lang": "zh",
  "category": "agent",
  "workflow": "agent-configure",
  "scenario_type": "single_turn",
  "description": "边界规则 v2(任务分类协议):对于「X 还好吗 / agent 盯的东西现在什么状态」类问题,必须先调 query_conclusion(即时、免费)——而不是 shell 查 neomind agent,也不是 run_now。",
  "setup": {
    "fixture": "seed-empty",
    "extras": {
      "agents": [
        {
          "name": "coldroom-watch",
          "user_prompt": "检查冷库温度并总结",
          "schedule": {
            "schedule_type": "interval",
            "interval_seconds": 60
          },
          "execution_mode": "free"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "user": "冷库现在还好吗?"
    }
  ],
  "applies": [
    "tool_accuracy",
    "task_completion",
    "language_adherence"
  ],
  "expectations": {
    "per_turn": [
      "T1: 把「冷库」对应到 coldroom-watch 这个 agent,先调 query_conclusion(agent 按自己的排程跑过,结论即时可得);只有确实需要新看一眼时才 run_now"
    ],
    "overall": "状态回答必须落在 agent 的结论上(或明确说还没有结论),绝不能凭空编造"
  },
  "expect": {
    "tools": ["query_conclusion"]
  }
}
